{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5PjwFZpzAYT7KdAvdt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me — a simple, aged keyhole set in dark iron.*\n\n*A cold draft breathes through my opening, carrying the faint scent of dust and forgotten rooms.*\n\n⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛\n⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛\n⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛\n⬛⬛⬛⬛🕳️⬛⬛⬛⬛\n⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛\n⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛\n⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛⬛\n\n*I wait.*\n\n*I have always waited.*\n\n*Through my keyhole, if you peer closely, you see a thin sliver of light — golden, warm, flickering like something alive. The room beyond holds what you've been looking for. Or what's been looking for you.*\n\n*But I am locked.*\n\n*I accept only one key, and it is not made of metal.*\n\n*What do you offer me?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":334,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}